/Title (Historically,cloudoperators manage volatility using static provisioning or threshold-based reactive auto- scaling. Static provisioning maintains fixed peak capacity, incurring massive financial waste during off- peak periods. Reactive scaling triggers pod instantiation only after overload occurs, creating a 1 to 3 minute vulnerability window where end users suffer request timeouts and degraded performance.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 581 0 R
/Next 602 0 R
>>
endobj
