/Title (Predictive Time-Series Pipeline: Developing multi-step forecasting models comparing statistical baselines \(ARIMA\), machine learning ensembles \(Random Forest, XGBoost\), and deep sequence models \(LSTM, GRU\) to forecast CPU utilization, memory demand, and request arrival rates. Closed-Loop Kubernetes Control: Building a custom auto-scaling control loop that interacts directly with the Minikube/Kubernetes cluster REST API to execute pre-emptive pod scaling actions. Quantifiable Outcomes: Minimizing prediction error \(MAE and RMSE\), eliminating transient SLA violations under synthetic burst traffic, and achieving a 20% to 30% reduction in cluster compute over-provisioning and energy usage.)
